<section class="thesis">
  <div class="container">
    <div><div class="num">490<small>Matthew 18:22</small></div></div>
    <div>
      <h2>We are scorekeepers by birth. <em>Grace is the end of the ledger.</em></h2>
      <p style="margin-top:1.1rem">Without ever deciding to, we keep a record of every wrong done to us, and we cannot put it down. Jesus answered Peter's math with a number too big to track on purpose. Not a higher limit. The end of limits.</p>
      <p>That is the whole of 490.life: Scripture taught plainly, a God whose forgiveness has no ceiling, and the daily work of forgiving others from a heart that has already been forgiven. Wherever you stand with God, this is a place to begin.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

